      ],
      "text": "Configuration can be supplied via environment variables (OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_MODEL, OPENAI_BASE_URL, and generic CORO_BASE_URL/CORO_MODEL overrides) or a `coro.json` file specifying protocol, base_url, api_key, model, and sampling params such as max_tokens, temperature, and top_p."
